  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Brown the rest-meat in a large pan over medium heat. ",
    "Add the onion and garlic to the pan and sauté until softened. ",
    "Add the mushrooms and cook until they release their moisture.",
    "Mix the flour with a little water to create a slurry. ",
    "Gradually add the flour slurry to the pan, stirring to prevent lumps. ",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes. ",
    "Stir in the cultured creme fraiche and cook for a further 2 minutes. ",
    "Season with salt, black pepper, and ground nutmeg. ",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish. ",
    "Melt the butter and sprinkle it over the top of the casserole.",
    "Dot the top of the casserole with the butter and sprinkle with parsley. ",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25 minutes. ",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
